{"id":"3d6e0e629b7557a3","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-levy-proofterm-lifting.md","title":"Lévy证明项提升","display":"df-levy-proofterm-lifting — Lévy证明项提升","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-df-levy-proofterm-lifting","aliases":["56-df-levy-proofterm-lifting"],"display":"df-levy-proofterm-lifting — Lévy证明项提升","depends_on":["[[56-df-levy-rule-lifting]]","[[56-df-proofterm-substitution]]"],"source_section":"§8.4 Definition 8.4.30; Exercise 8.4.32","source_printed_pages":"350–351","source_statement_status":"compared-to-local-djvu-ocr-and-selected-page-images; explicit-tag-coding-local","source_proof_status":"source-definition-compared; local-well-definedness-derivation-in-Remark; not-machine-formalized"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-levy-proofterm-lifting"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-levy-proofterm-lifting</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-levy-proofterm-lifting — Lévy证明项提升"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b2ae6f5d85c77f9b\" href=\"?note=b2ae6f5d85c77f9b\" title=\"56-df-levy-rule-lifting\">56-df-levy-rule-lifting</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b93c21fedffb4c4c\" href=\"?note=b93c21fedffb4c4c\" title=\"56-df-proofterm-substitution\">56-df-proofterm-substitution</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§8.4 Definition 8.4.30; Exercise 8.4.32"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"350–351"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"compared-to-local-djvu-ocr-and-selected-page-images; explicit-tag-coding-local"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"source-definition-compared; local-well-definedness-derivation-in-Remark; not-machine-formalized"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b2ae6f5d85c77f9b\" href=\"?note=b2ae6f5d85c77f9b\" title=\"56-df-levy-rule-lifting\">56-df-levy-rule-lifting</a> 的左线性系统与 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b93c21fedffb4c4c\" href=\"?note=b93c21fedffb4c4c\" title=\"56-df-proofterm-substitution\">56-df-proofterm-substitution</a> 的证明项构造器；在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R^L\">\\(R^L\\)</span> 中每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda^L(\\ell)\">\\(\\lambda^L(\\ell)\\)</span> 沿用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span> 的变量枚举。各递归分支仅取下文定义的域 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P_R^L\">\\(\\mathcal P_R^L\\)</span> 中的输入；函数构造分支有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\hat s=c(\\hat s_1,\\ldots,\\hat s_n)\">\\(\\hat s=c(\\hat s_1,\\ldots,\\hat s_n)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{er}_L(c)=f\">\\(\\operatorname{er}_L(c)=f\\)</span>；规则构造分支有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda=(l,r)\">\\(\\lambda=(l,r)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell=\\operatorname{Skel}_R(\\hat s,(\\epsilon,l,r))\">\\(\\ell=\\operatorname{Skel}_R(\\hat s,(\\epsilon,l,r))\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\hat\\sigma=\\operatorname{Match}_R^L(\\hat s,(\\epsilon,l,r))\">\\(\\hat\\sigma=\\operatorname{Match}_R^L(\\hat s,(\\epsilon,l,r))\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P_R^L\\coloneqq\\{(\\hat s,\\phi)\\in T_R^L\\times\\operatorname{PT}_R:\\operatorname{erase}_L(\\hat s)=S_R(\\phi)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal P_R^L\\coloneqq\\{(\\hat s,\\phi)\\in T_R^L\\times\\operatorname{PT}_R:\\operatorname{erase}_L(\\hat s)=S_R(\\phi)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LPT}_R(x,\\mathsf X(x))\\coloneqq\\mathsf X(x).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{LPT}_R(x,\\mathsf X(x))\\coloneqq\\mathsf X(x).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LPT}_R(c(\\hat s_1,\\ldots,\\hat s_n),\\mathsf F(f;\\phi_1,\\ldots,\\phi_n))\\coloneqq\\mathsf F(c;\\operatorname{LPT}_R(\\hat s_1,\\phi_1),\\ldots,\\operatorname{LPT}_R(\\hat s_n,\\phi_n)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{LPT}_R(c(\\hat s_1,\\ldots,\\hat s_n),\\mathsf F(f;\\phi_1,\\ldots,\\phi_n))\\coloneqq\\mathsf F(c;\\operatorname{LPT}_R(\\hat s_1,\\phi_1),\\ldots,\\operatorname{LPT}_R(\\hat s_n,\\phi_n)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LPT}_R(\\hat s,\\mathsf L(\\lambda;\\phi_1,\\ldots,\\phi_{k_\\lambda}))\\coloneqq\\mathsf L(\\lambda^L(\\ell);\\operatorname{LPT}_R(\\hat\\sigma(x_{\\lambda,1}),\\phi_1),\\ldots,\\operatorname{LPT}_R(\\hat\\sigma(x_{\\lambda,k_\\lambda}),\\phi_{k_\\lambda})).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{LPT}_R(\\hat s,\\mathsf L(\\lambda;\\phi_1,\\ldots,\\phi_{k_\\lambda}))\\coloneqq\\mathsf L(\\lambda^L(\\ell);\\operatorname{LPT}_R(\\hat\\sigma(x_{\\lambda,1}),\\phi_1),\\ldots,\\operatorname{LPT}_R(\\hat\\sigma(x_{\\lambda,k_\\lambda}),\\phi_{k_\\lambda})).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LPT}_R(\\hat s,\\phi\\bullet\\psi)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{LPT}_R(\\hat s,\\phi)\\bullet\\operatorname{LPT}_R(T_{R^L}(\\operatorname{LPT}_R(\\hat s,\\phi)),\\psi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{LPT}_R(\\hat s,\\phi\\bullet\\psi)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{LPT}_R(\\hat s,\\phi)\\bullet\\operatorname{LPT}_R(T_{R^L}(\\operatorname{LPT}_R(\\hat s,\\phi)),\\psi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LPT}_R(\\hat s,\\phi)\\in\\operatorname{PT}_{R^L},\\qquad S_{R^L}(\\operatorname{LPT}_R(\\hat s,\\phi))=\\hat s,\\qquad \\operatorname{erase}_L(T_{R^L}(\\operatorname{LPT}_R(\\hat s,\\phi)))=T_R(\\phi)\\quad((\\hat s,\\phi)\\in\\mathcal P_R^L).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{LPT}_R(\\hat s,\\phi)\\in\\operatorname{PT}_{R^L},\\qquad S_{R^L}(\\operatorname{LPT}_R(\\hat s,\\phi))=\\hat s,\\qquad \\operatorname{erase}_L(T_{R^L}(\\operatorname{LPT}_R(\\hat s,\\phi)))=T_R(\\phi)\\quad((\\hat s,\\phi)\\in\\mathcal P_R^L).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>递归严格沿证明项构造树进行。函数分支逐个子证明提升；规则分支的左项函数位标签在参数子证明归约中不动，因此标签规则固定为λ^L(ℓ)，子证明只作用在变量实例中；组合先提升第一项，再用其实际标记目标作为第二项的源。类型与擦除结论由结构归纳证明，同一步论证证明每次递归调用合法。这里不能每个组合重新做LInit，否则会丢失历史并破坏置换方程。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-levy-rule-lifting","status":"resolved","id":"b2ae6f5d85c77f9b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-levy-rule-lifting]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-proofterm-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"b93c21fedffb4c4c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-proofterm-substitution]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-levy-rule-lifting","status":"resolved","id":"b2ae6f5d85c77f9b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"使用 [[56-df-levy-rule-lifting]] 的左线性系统与 [[56-df-proofterm-substitution]] 的证明项构造器；在 $R^L$ 中每个 $\\lambda^L(\\ell)$ 沿用 $\\lambda$ 的变量枚举。各递归分支仅取下文定义的域 $\\mathcal P_R^L$ 中的输入；函数构造分支有 $\\hat s=c(\\hat s_1,\\ldots,\\hat s_n)$、$\\operatorname{er}_L(c)=f$；规则构造分支有 $\\lambda=(l,r)$，$\\ell=\\operatorname{Skel}_R(\\hat s,(\\epsilon,l,r))$，$\\hat\\sigma=\\operatorname{Match}_R^L(\\hat s,(\\epsilon,l,r))$。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-proofterm-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"b93c21fedffb4c4c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"使用 [[56-df-levy-rule-lifting]] 的左线性系统与 [[56-df-proofterm-substitution]] 的证明项构造器；在 $R^L$ 中每个 $\\lambda^L(\\ell)$ 沿用 $\\lambda$ 的变量枚举。各递归分支仅取下文定义的域 $\\mathcal P_R^L$ 中的输入；函数构造分支有 $\\hat s=c(\\hat s_1,\\ldots,\\hat s_n)$、$\\operatorname{er}_L(c)=f$；规则构造分支有 $\\lambda=(l,r)$，$\\ell=\\operatorname{Skel}_R(\\hat s,(\\epsilon,l,r))$，$\\hat\\sigma=\\operatorname{Match}_R^L(\\hat s,(\\epsilon,l,r))$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"R^L","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda^L(\\ell)","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P_R^L","display":false},{"tex":"\\hat s=c(\\hat s_1,\\ldots,\\hat s_n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{er}_L(c)=f","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda=(l,r)","display":false},{"tex":"\\ell=\\operatorname{Skel}_R(\\hat s,(\\epsilon,l,r))","display":false},{"tex":"\\hat\\sigma=\\operatorname{Match}_R^L(\\hat s,(\\epsilon,l,r))","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P_R^L\\coloneqq\\{(\\hat s,\\phi)\\in T_R^L\\times\\operatorname{PT}_R:\\operatorname{erase}_L(\\hat s)=S_R(\\phi)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{LPT}_R(x,\\mathsf X(x))\\coloneqq\\mathsf X(x).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{LPT}_R(c(\\hat s_1,\\ldots,\\hat s_n),\\mathsf F(f;\\phi_1,\\ldots,\\phi_n))\\coloneqq\\mathsf F(c;\\operatorname{LPT}_R(\\hat s_1,\\phi_1),\\ldots,\\operatorname{LPT}_R(\\hat s_n,\\phi_n)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{LPT}_R(\\hat s,\\mathsf L(\\lambda;\\phi_1,\\ldots,\\phi_{k_\\lambda}))\\coloneqq\\mathsf L(\\lambda^L(\\ell);\\operatorname{LPT}_R(\\hat\\sigma(x_{\\lambda,1}),\\phi_1),\\ldots,\\operatorname{LPT}_R(\\hat\\sigma(x_{\\lambda,k_\\lambda}),\\phi_{k_\\lambda})).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{LPT}_R(\\hat s,\\phi\\bullet\\psi)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{LPT}_R(\\hat s,\\phi)\\bullet\\operatorname{LPT}_R(T_{R^L}(\\operatorname{LPT}_R(\\hat s,\\phi)),\\psi).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{LPT}_R(\\hat s,\\phi)\\in\\operatorname{PT}_{R^L},\\qquad S_{R^L}(\\operatorname{LPT}_R(\\hat s,\\phi))=\\hat s,\\qquad \\operatorname{erase}_L(T_{R^L}(\\operatorname{LPT}_R(\\hat s,\\phi)))=T_R(\\phi)\\quad((\\hat s,\\phi)\\in\\mathcal P_R^L).","display":true}],"bytes":2773,"backlinks":[{"id":"05ef806ab27a7169","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"使用 [[56-df-levy-proofterm-lifting]] 与 [[56-lem-levy-lifting]]。$\\phi,\\psi\\in\\operatorname{PT}_R$ 共源，$\\hat s\\in T_R^L$ 满足 $\\operatorname{erase}_L(\\hat s)=S_R(\\phi)=S_R(\\psi)$。置换等价与具体路径证明项见 [[56-df-proofterm-permutation]]、[[56-df-proofterm-embedding]]。$\\rho,\\eta\\in\\mathcal F_R$ 共源，且 $\\operatorname{erase}_L(\\hat s)=\\operatorname{src}(\\rho)=\\operatorname{src}(\\eta)$。"},{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-151","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-df-levy-proofterm-lifting.md]]"}],"outgoing":["b2ae6f5d85c77f9b","b93c21fedffb4c4c"]}